#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:1001
msgid "Kerberos realm for this deployment:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:1001
msgid ""
"KerBridge serves one Kerberos realm, in upper case, for example EXAMPLE."
"SITE. Six further values are derived from it -- the domain root, the DNS "
"domain, the NetBIOS name, the domain controller's short name and two "
"organisational units -- so this is the one answer the rest of the "
"configuration is built out of."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:1001
msgid ""
"The realm is baked into the Samba database the day the domain is "
"provisioned, along with the domain SID and every filesystem ACL that carries "
"it. It cannot be corrected afterwards without provisioning again."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:1001
msgid ""
"These answers are used on first install only, to write a configuration set "
"that is not there yet. No package ever edits a configuration file you "
"already have: reconfiguring asks again, sees the files, and leaves them "
"alone. Leave this empty and nothing at all is written, which is the right "
"outcome for an unattended install with no answers to give."
msgstr ""

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:2001
msgid "Invalid Kerberos realm"
msgstr ""

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:2001
msgid ""
"A realm is a dotted domain name with no spaces in it, such as EXAMPLE.SITE. "
"The value entered is not one."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:3001
msgid "LDAPS URL of the domain controller:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:3001
msgid ""
"The address KerBridge binds to, ldaps:// only -- plain LDAP and StartTLS are "
"both refused where this is read, because the bind password and every "
"password sync writes would otherwise cross the network in the clear."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:3001
msgid ""
"The proposed value names a domain controller called \"kerbridge\" inside the "
"realm above. Change the host if yours is called something else; the short "
"name is taken from this URL's first label."
msgstr ""

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:4001
msgid "Invalid LDAPS URL"
msgstr ""

#. Type: error
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:4001
msgid ""
"The URL must begin with ldaps:// . Plain ldap:// and StartTLS are refused by "
"KerBridge itself, so an address entered here in that form would only fail "
"later."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:5001
msgid "Cloud IdP tenant id:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:5001
msgid ""
"The Microsoft Entra ID tenant whose users this deployment admits, as a UUID."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:5001
msgid ""
"Leave this empty for a host that runs no synchronisation and serves no sign-"
"ins -- an administrator's machine with kerbridge-manage on it, for instance. "
"The configuration set is still written, with no identity provider listed in "
"it, and a provider can be added later by editing the files."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:5001
msgid ""
"This is not a secret. Tenant and client ids are public OIDC identifiers, and "
"no KerBridge credential is ever passed through debconf."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:6001
msgid "Application id of the broker API registration:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:6001
msgid ""
"The Entra application registration that the broker validates access tokens "
"for -- the audience a client asks its token to be issued for."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:7001
msgid "Application id of the workstation client registration:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:7001
msgid ""
"The public Entra application registration the workstation agent signs in "
"with. It is handed to clients by the broker, so a client needs no "
"configuration of its own beyond the address."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:8001
msgid "Application id of the synchronisation registration:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:8001
msgid ""
"The confidential Entra application registration kerbridge-sync reads the "
"directory with. Its client secret or certificate is a file under /etc/"
"kerbridge.secrets/, named in the configuration and never held here."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:9001
msgid "Name of the cloud group whose members are admitted:"
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:9001
msgid ""
"Membership of this group is what admits an identity: users outside it are "
"not mirrored into the directory and every sign-in for them is refused. "
"Nothing works until a group by this name exists in the tenant, so create it "
"if you have not already."
msgstr ""

#. Type: string
#. Description
#: ../kerbridge-config.templates:9001
msgid ""
"The proposed name is only a suggestion -- any group will do. Once the realm "
"is live, replace the name with the group's object id in /etc/kerbridge/"
"idp_entra.toml: a group that is renamed or recreated can otherwise resolve "
"to one you did not choose."
msgstr ""
